Lands control-combo: grind resources with Life from the Loam recurring Wasteland + Rishadan Port to strand the opponent off mana, while The Tabernacle and Maze of Ith neutralize creatures. Assemble the Dark Depths + Thespian's Stage combo for a 20/20 Marit Lage. Exploration/Mox Diamond accelerate; Punishing Fire + Grove grinds small creatures. Win slow and inevitable.
